findings.what:
**Splash.** The splash is the 3D victory hold pasted on the painted map_rift plate:
- figure grain and fireflies, against a clean plate;
- neutral grey light against a warm dusk scene;
- one frontal static pose, shared by all three skins (Gorgewalk swaps the plate).

**Portrait.** The 512 px portrait is an extreme close-up of the mask. Only the brim band shows: the dome and all three windows are cropped. It has two black spike artifacts (beak tip, right mouth corner) and a hard bright slab at the right edge.

**Collection and draft.** The skin tiles are three near-identical crops of the brim, and the draft card shows the same crop.
